\item[S2] Fred Tyrrell, \emph{New Lower Bounds for Cap Sets}, Discrete Analysis 2023:20; arXiv:2209.10045v2, Definition 1.1 and Section 1. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2209.10045v2}.
